modeled after this store here.

00:10:30.696 --> 00:10:33.662
So, I'm excited to see
if they carry my book.

00:10:33.662 --> 00:10:36.662
(soft techno music)

00:10:39.012 --> 00:10:42.139
Well, good news bad
news. They're sold out.

00:10:42.139 --> 00:10:43.832
So, I guess that's a good thing.

00:10:43.832 --> 00:10:46.253
But I wanted to see it, in the store.

00:10:46.253 --> 00:10:50.420
So, thank you to the London
Believe Nation folk who

00:10:51.624 --> 00:10:54.874
supported the book and sold Foyles out.

00:10:55.978 --> 00:10:58.816
And Foyles, let's get going on a re-order.

00:10:58.816 --> 00:11:01.163
I want to come and sign some
books and take some pictures

00:11:01.163 --> 00:11:04.447
and put it in the vlog next time.

00:11:04.447 --> 00:11:07.030
Alright, Nina and I
continue on with the day.

00:11:07.030 --> 00:11:10.197
(gentle guitar music)

00:11:12.584 --> 00:11:15.087
We are hunting for one of the most famous

00:11:15.087 --> 00:11:17.691
