00:11:17.691 --> 00:11:18.988
Nina wanted local food.

00:11:18.988 --> 00:11:20.478
London has a lot of
international restaurants

00:11:20.478 --> 00:11:22.080
but she didn't want to have Indonesian

00:11:22.080 --> 00:11:24.850
