00:11:24.850 --> 00:11:27.106
She wanted something London.

00:11:27.106 --> 00:11:29.717
So fish and chips.
That's what we're doing.

00:11:29.717 --> 00:11:33.005
And we're off to find one
of the most famous houses

00:11:33.005 --> 00:11:35.037
in London if we can find it.

00:11:35.037 --> 00:11:36.530
But there's so many options here.

00:11:36.530 --> 00:11:38.337
There's so many different restaurants.

00:11:38.337 --> 00:11:41.595
There's so much potential.
Nina wants to eat everywhere.

00:11:41.595 --> 00:11:42.539
- I want to eat everything.

00:11:42.539 --> 00:11:45.830
- (laughing) Save it
for the fish and chips.

00:11:45.830 --> 00:11:50.747
We found it. The Rock &amp;
Sole Plaice. Mmm. Smell it.

00:11:50.747 --> 00:11:55.303
Nina! You smell it?
Smell the fish and chips?

00:11:55.303 --> 00:11:57.248
Alright, we're going
to go get our food on.

00:11:57.248 --> 00:12:01.415
Here's the menu, look. Rock &amp;
Sole Plaice? It's spelt weird.

00:12:03.090 --> 00:12:05.090
Original fish and chips.

00:12:06.938 --> 00:12:08.492
- [Nina] I saw the fish.

00:12:08.492 --> 00:12:11.151
- [Evan] Authentic fish. I don't know.

00:12:11.151 --> 00:12:15.937
Mushy peas, look at that. Hot
mushy peas. Sounds amazing.

