00:13:05.722 --> 00:13:07.017
But I don't know.

00:13:07.017 --> 00:13:10.267
- [Evan] Try One. Just dip it and bite.

00:13:12.187 --> 00:13:13.643
It's okay?
- Mmhmm.

00:13:13.643 --> 00:13:17.444
- [Evan] Alright. And
this is what we came for.

00:13:17.444 --> 00:13:19.394
The fish and chips.

00:13:19.394 --> 00:13:23.187
We got some cod, some chips, tartar sacue?

