Dill sauce? Tartar sauce, I
guess. My mouth is watering.

00:13:26.900 --> 00:13:28.274
- Potato wedges.

00:13:28.274 --> 00:13:31.938
- [Evan] It's called a chip. It's a chip.

00:13:31.938 --> 00:13:34.344
I need some good ketchup on my chips.

00:13:34.344 --> 00:13:38.175
Good, I like it. It's cod time.
This is it. Moment of truth.

00:13:38.175 --> 00:13:39.592
Why we came here.

00:13:40.579 --> 00:13:43.954
Yeah, look at that white meat in there.

00:13:43.954 --> 00:13:46.107
Mmm yum yum yum yum yum.

00:13:46.107 --> 00:13:48.857
K, there it goes. And in it goes.

00:13:55.033 --> 00:13:57.366
And it's hot. Ooh! It's hot.

00:13:59.126 --> 00:14:01.026
- Mmm it's good. The fish is juicy.

00:14:01.026 --> 00:14:04.776
- Nice! Alright, high
five. Good place. Boom.

00:14:05.647 --> 00:14:08.814
So they've been doing this since 1871.

00:14:10.172 --> 00:14:11.839
How you doing, Nina?

00:14:12.870 --> 00:14:14.380
- Good.

00:14:14.380 --> 00:14:15.669
- [Evan] Full?
- Yeah.

00:14:15.669 --> 00:14:18.259
- [Evan] Nina's very full.
- Yeah.

00:14:18.259 --> 00:14:19.528
I'm ready to sleep.

00:14:19.528 --> 00:14:22.521
- [Evan] Ready to sleep. She's
chillin back on the bench.

00:14:22.521 --> 00:14:24.417
She left me all the fries to eat

00:14:24.417 --> 00:14:26.586
but she's going to finish her beer.

00:14:26.586 --> 00:14:30.058
The pigeon keeps stalking
us. He likes you.

00:14:30.058 --> 00:14:31.783
He's like, Nina feed me food.

00:14:31.783 --> 00:14:32.996
Nina.
- huh?

00:14:32.996 --> 00:14:34.936
- [Evan] Feed me food.

00:14:34.936 --> 00:14:36.093
The pigeon.

00:14:36.093 --> 00:14:37.589
- Feed the Evan first.

00:14:37.589 --> 00:14:38.992
- [Evan] Alright, I'm
still finishing the fries

00:14:38.992 --> 00:14:40.409
but dessert came.

00:14:41.592 --> 00:14:44.730
Sticky toffee with ice cream

00:14:44.730 --> 00:14:46.910
and caramel sauce and Nina's
going to give it a shot.

00:14:46.910 --> 00:14:47.993
Come on Nina.

00:14:52.316 --> 00:14:53.619
Yeah?
- That's good.

00:14:53.619 --> 00:14:56.233
- [Evan] Am I going to have any
left when I finish my fries?

00:14:56.233 --> 00:14:57.066
- Maybe.

00:14:58.733 --> 00:15:02.066
- Okay, we're done eating. I am so full.

00:15:02.901 --> 00:15:04.782
That brownie thing was amazing,

00:15:04.782 --> 00:15:06.432
the toffee pudding, whatever?

00:15:06.432 --> 00:15:07.265
- Yeah, it's good.

00:15:07.265 --> 00:15:11.182
- And then the beer and
the fries, it was good.

00:15:12.280 --> 00:15:14.511
I'm feeling full.
- I'm full.

00:15:14.511 --> 00:15:17.655
We're going to walk back to the hotel.

00:15:17.655 --> 00:15:21.258
I feel like I need a good
walk. Got to walk it off.

00:15:21.258 --> 00:15:26.140
Got to walk it off. Not used
to eating this much food.

00:15:26.140 --> 00:15:28.307
Shawn has us on this--

00:15:28.307 --> 00:15:31.391
- [Nina] Restricted diet.
- Stricted, strict diet.

00:15:31.391 --> 00:15:34.104
Which did not include any of this food.

00:15:34.104 --> 00:15:35.500
(laughing)

00:15:35.500 --> 00:15:38.825
None of this food
included so it feels good

00:15:38.825 --> 00:15:42.092
and it feels terrible at the same time.

00:15:42.092 --> 00:15:44.477
But our stomachs I think
are going to stretch

00:15:44.477 --> 00:15:45.916
at the end of this.

00:15:45.916 --> 00:15:49.838
So, we're going to find
our way back to the hotel.

00:15:49.838 --> 00:15:50.755
Here we go.

00:15:52.699 --> 00:15:54.116
Nina misses Timo.

00:15:58.391 --> 00:16:02.308
Nina misses Timo. Every
dog she's seen she's...

00:16:04.385 --> 00:16:06.975
Every dog she's seen she says is cute.

00:16:06.975 --> 00:16:09.742
Look at her smile here. There's a smile.

00:16:09.742 --> 00:16:12.498
Look at the big Nina smile. You miss Timo.

00:16:12.498 --> 00:16:14.684
It's only been one day, ya know.

00:16:14.684 --> 00:16:18.282
It hasn't even been 24 hours.
It's okay. It's Nina love.

00:16:18.282 --> 00:16:20.629
It's all Nina love.

00:16:20.629 --> 00:16:23.212
(upbeat music)

00:16:25.226 --> 00:16:27.115
We decided to buy some snacks

00:16:27.115 --> 00:16:31.246
just in case we got hungry
even though our faces are full

00:16:31.246 --> 00:16:34.852
and our stomachs are insanely crunched

00:16:34.852 --> 00:16:37.835
we decided that we need
some snacks just in case.

00:16:37.835 --> 00:16:41.418
So we bought Candy
Kittens Wild Strawberry,

00:16:43.152 --> 00:16:45.819
Sour Watermelon gourmet candies.

00:16:48.015 --> 00:16:50.978
Some pringles, sour cream and onion

00:16:50.978 --> 00:16:53.978
and cheese and onion and then two...

00:16:55.583 --> 00:16:59.017
What is that? Spicy lobster noodles...

00:16:59.017 --> 00:16:59.850
And?

00:17:02.859 --> 00:17:06.196
Chicken abalone. I don't
like the chicken abalone.

00:17:06.196 --> 00:17:07.995
- It's just a flavor.

00:17:07.995 --> 00:17:08.828
- [Evan] Alright.

00:17:08.828 --> 00:17:09.939
- You won't like it, trust me.

00:17:09.939 --> 00:17:11.255
- [Evan] Tomorrow we get on
the cruise ship so we got to

00:17:11.255 --> 00:17:13.468
eat all this before tomorrow.
What do you think Nina?

00:17:13.468 --> 00:17:15.189
(laughing)
- We didn't have forks.

00:17:15.189 --> 00:17:16.687
- [Evan] Maybe. What?

00:17:16.687 --> 00:17:17.790
- We didn't have forks.

00:17:17.790 --> 00:17:18.945
- [Evan] We don't have forks.

00:17:18.945 --> 00:17:21.282
- Yeah, we don't have forks.

00:17:21.282 --> 00:17:23.446
Oh, just go in here and get it.

00:17:23.446 --> 00:17:25.153
- [Evan] Where?

00:17:25.153 --> 00:17:29.496
- Pret A Manger. Alright.
Nina's going to get some forks.

00:17:29.496 --> 00:17:32.163
(bells chiming)

00:17:39.007 --> 00:17:41.734
Alright, so it is the end of day one--

00:17:41.734 --> 00:17:44.829
- Officially for us.
Yesterday was day zero.

00:17:44.829 --> 00:17:48.318
Thank you guys for joining us.
The sun is setting on London.

00:17:48.318 --> 00:17:51.883
We made it, we made it. Jet lag is decent.

00:17:51.883 --> 00:17:55.693
We're going to go to the
hotel shower, cleanup,

00:17:55.693 --> 00:18:00.382
maybe have some noodles,
watch some Agents of Shield,

00:18:00.382 --> 00:18:03.618
go to bed and get ready
tomorrow to wake up

00:18:03.618 --> 00:18:04.941
and go on the cruise.

00:18:04.941 --> 00:18:06.533
What was the highlight of the day?

00:18:06.533 --> 00:18:08.358
- I got stopped. (laughing)

00:18:08.358 --> 00:18:09.297
- You got stopped?

00:18:09.297 --> 00:18:11.884
You got stopped on the
street and say "Hey Nina".

00:18:11.884 --> 00:18:14.304
(laughing) You're a celebrity?

00:18:14.304 --> 00:18:17.710
We need to get Nina Carmichael
shirts now just for Nina.

00:18:17.710 --> 00:18:20.547
Guys, if you're watching, if
you ever see Nina on the street

00:18:20.547 --> 00:18:24.424
make sure you say hi because
we flew here to London

00:18:24.424 --> 00:18:25.484
and the highlight was that

00:18:25.484 --> 00:18:27.724
somebody stopped her on the street.

00:18:27.724 --> 00:18:29.640
So, I feel like we can make that happen

00:18:29.640 --> 00:18:32.027
in multiple places now just for Nina.

00:18:32.027 --> 00:18:34.975
Thank you guys for watching.
Have an amazing weekend.

00:18:34.975 --> 00:18:38.385
Continue to believe in
whatever your one word is.

00:18:38.385 --> 00:18:40.885
Much love! We'll see you soon!

